{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101951","id":2293811479,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6IuMkX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101951","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101951.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101951.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101951","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101951/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101951/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101951/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d6312188d7b170c279ffd35b45bf6af50c109b4c","number":101951,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for the OpenXR futures extension","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR introduces the OpenXR Future extension which allows asynchronous calls into APIs from extensions that use the future extension.\r\n\r\nWhen a future is created as an asynchronous function call is made, we can register this future with a callable that will be invoked when the function call finishes.\r\n\r\nAs Godot requires that classes inherit from Godots `Object` class for callables to work. This PR also changes `OpenXRExtensionWrapper` to inherit from `Object` and updates all existing extension classes accordingly.\r\n\r\n`OpenXRExtensionWrapperExtension` is also changed to now just inherit from `OpenXRExtensionWrapper`. Outwardly this shouldn't change and shouldn't break existing GDExtension based OpenXR extension wrappers but this does need to be tested.\r\n\r\nThis PR will remain in draft until testing is done with APIs that apply the future approach and I can confirm this is the correct way to go forward. Looking for feedback from other core XR devs.\r\n\r\n*Contributed by Khronos Group through the Godot Integration Project*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https